   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Nothing about 10.244.x.x is in the VMs' own network config. The /24s are decided by Kubernetes and stored in etcd;\nFlannel reads them and only then creates cni0, flannel.1 and the routes on each machine.",
